        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You customize your armor with the symbols and seals of your command. You treat medium armor as light armor when determining your proficiency, and you treat heavy armor as medium armor. You customize your armor with Peacekeeper Adornments, gaining the armor specialization effects of that armor. While wearing this armor, you gain an item bonus to Intimidation checks equal to your armor's resilience value.</p>"
